{"t":"ALL","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"The Allstate Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","employees":53000,"hq":"Northbrook, IL, United States","website":"https://www.allstate.com","summary_en":"The Allstate Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, provides property and casualty, and other insurance products in the United States and Canada. It operates in four segments: Allstate Protection; Run-off Property-Liability; Protection Services; and Corporate and Other. The company offers private passenger auto, homeowners, other personal lines and commercial insurance through exclusive agents, independent agents, contact centers and online under the Allstate, National General, Direct Auto and Answer Financial brands. It also provides consumer product protection plans, device and mobile data collection services, and analytic solutions using automotive telematics information, roadside assistance, and protection plans; and insurance products, such as identity protection and restoration. In addition, the company offers property and casualty insurance, as well as engages in company activities and certain non-insurance operations, including expenses associated with strategic initiatives. Further, it offers automotive protection; vehicle service contracts, guaranteed asset protection, road hazard tires and wheels, and paintless dent repair protection; and roadside assistance, mobility data collection services, and analytic solutions using automotive telematics information, identity theft protection, and remediation services. The Allstate Corporation was founded in 1931 and is headquartered in Northbrook, Illinois.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Allstate Corporation은 자회사와 함께 미국과 캐나다에서 재산, 상해 및 기타 보험 상품을 제공합니다. 이는 4개 부문으로 운영됩니다: Allstate Protection; 유출 재산 책임; 보호 서비스; 기업 및 기타. 이 회사는 Allstate, National General, Direct Auto 및 Answer Financial 브랜드로 독점 대리점, 독립 대리점, 연락 센터 및 온라인을 통해 개인 승용차, 주택 소유자, 기타 개인 보험 및 상업 보험을 제공합니다. 또한 소비자 제품 보호 계획, 장치 및 모바일 데이터 수집 서비스, 자동차 텔레매틱스 정보, 길가 지원 및 보호 계획을 사용한 분석 솔루션을 제공합니다. 신원 보호 및 복원과 같은 보험 상품. 또한 회사는 재산 및 상해 보험을 제공할 뿐만 아니라 전략적 계획과 관련된 비용을 포함하여 회사 활동 및 특정 비보험 운영에 참여합니다. 또한 자동차 보호 기능도 제공합니다. 차량 서비스 계약, 자산 보호 보장, 도로 위험 타이어 및 휠, 페인트 없는 덴트 수리 보호; 도로 지원, 모빌리티 데이터 수집 서비스, 자동차 텔레매틱스 정보를 사용한 분석 솔루션, 신원 도용 방지 및 치료 서비스를 제공합니다. Allstate Corporation은 1931년에 설립되었으며 일리노이주 노스브룩에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":266.72,"mcap":67442274304.0,"pe":6.049444,"fpe":9.487078,"peg":1.9787,"ps":0.9615791,"pb":2.423956,"ev_ebitda":4.195,"div":1.61,"beta":0.116,"hi52":281.11,"lo52":191.13},"fin":{"rev":70137004032.0,"rev_g":0.118,"eps_g":0.612,"gross":0.36800998,"op":0.22827,"net":0.18971,"roe":0.46113998,"fcf":15158625280.0,"cash":5714999808.0,"debt":7496999936.0,"de":22.261,"eps":44.09,"feps":28.11403},"own":{"short":0.0001,"inst":0.86420995,"insider":0.0049799997},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":269.27274,"median":270.5,"high":340.0,"low":191.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.44,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":10,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":10,"sell":2,"strongSell":2},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":10,"sell":3,"strongSell":2},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":10,"sell":3,"strongSell":2}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":228.0,"priorPriceTarget":221.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"In-Line","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":269.0,"priorPriceTarget":262.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":236.0,"priorPriceTarget":250.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Keefe, Bruyette & Woods","ToGrade":"Underperform","Fro